visor Role Description</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://schoolhealthassociates.com/school-nurse-procedures/\" target=\"_blank\">School Health Associates:&nbsp;School Nurse Procedures</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20School%20Nurse%20Evaluation%20Tool%20-%2012.2.2025.pdf\">School Nurse Evaluation Tool</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.maine.gov/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20Toileting%20Support%20Recource%20-%206.08.2026.pdf\">Toileting Resource</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://medlineplus.gov/languages/languages.html\" target=\"_blank\">Translated Health Information</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"contact-cube\">\r\n<h3><strong>Contact</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p paraeid=\"{b4edfa76-4015-45cf-ab3a-0d78f41ceee6}{184}\" paraid=\"803522662\"><strong>Emily Poland, MPH, RN,&nbsp;NCSN&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\n<em>School Nurse Consultant</em><br />\r\nCoordinated School Health Team Leader<br />\r\n<strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"mailto:emily.poland@maine.gov\">Emily.Poland@maine.gov</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-contact-link\"><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></p>\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">School nurses provide emergency care, preventive services (e.g., immunizations, screenings), and coordinate with families and providers to keep students healthy and ready to learn. The <a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20School%20Nurse%20Evaluation%20Tool%20-%2012.2.2025.pdf\">Maine School Nurse Evaluation Tool: School Nurse Competencies and Evaluation</a> helps guide growth, goal setting, and evaluation, aligning with the <a href=\"https://www.nasn.org/nasn-resources/framework\" target=\"_blank\">NASN School Nursing Practice Framework™.</a> Like teachers and administrators, nurses should be supported through professional development and evaluation systems. School nurses operate within both health and education systems, facing unique legal, policy, and ethical challenges. The <a href=\"https://www.nasn.org/nasn-resources/professional-topics/codeofethics\" target=\"_blank\">NASN Code of Ethics</a> offers guidance for practice.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Resources available through Maine DOE and national organizations include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Guidance documents and protocols for student health</li>\r\n\t<li>Professional practice resources for school nurses</li>\r\n\t<li>Additional tools to strengthen school health services\r\n\t\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-left\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Guidelines for School Health Services</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/healthed/nurseresources/manual/chronic\">Chronic Conditions Management</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/node/3615\">Communicable Disease</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/node/320\">Concussion Management</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"http://www.maine.gov/doe/schools/safeschools/healthed/nurseresources/manual/oversight\">Delegation, Coordination, &amp; Oversight</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/School%20Health%20Services%20-%20Early%20Childhood%20Health%20Resources%20-%206.10.2026.pdf\">Early Childhood Health and Safety</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/node/4421\">Emergency Care</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><